00:00:00.459 --> 00:00:04.980
Speaker 1: Pharmaceutical company Pfizer says
that an oral drug for covid-19 could be ready

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:06.020
next year.

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:11.660
Pfizer is working on two antivirals, an oral
medication and an injectable.

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:16.720
The company started an early stage clinical
trial of the oral drug last month.

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:20.869
The drug blocks a critical enzyme that the
virus needs to replicate.

00:00:20.869 --> 00:00:22.220
It's very interesting.

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:27.160
Here is Pfizer CEO Albert Ballah talking about
this this morning on CNBC

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:28.509
